About BoardGameGeek data

This software queries data from BoardGameGeek (https://boardgamegeek.com) through the
BGG XML API2, subject to the BGG XML API Terms of Use.

No BoardGameGeek data is redistributed with this software. Each user must register their
own application and obtain their own access token at
https://boardgamegeek.com/applications before using the research tooling.

Any locally built index or downloaded ranking dump lives under `data/`, which is excluded
from version control and must not be committed or redistributed.

